s have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-21T22:38:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Eugene Hilton Jr. breaks out his father's 'T-Y' touchdown celebration","description":"Eugene Hilton Jr. is the son of T.Y. Hilton, who made four Pro Bowls with the Indianapolis Colts.","published":"2026-11-21T22:08:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50553909/eugene-hilton-jr-wisconsin-ty-celebration","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"BYU retains CFP hopes, beats Kansas in triple overtime","description":"Bear Bachmeier connected with Jojo Phillips in the back of the end zone in the third overtime, helping No. 10 BYU beat Kansas to keep its CFP hopes alive.","published":"2026-11-21T22:07:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50553754/byu-retains-cfp-hopes-beats-kansas-triple-over","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska snaps AP Top 25 losing skid, upsets Ohio State","description":"Nebraska broke its 31-game losing streak against AP Top 25 opponents with a 31-28 victory over No. 16 Ohio State on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-21T22:21:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50553426/nebraska-snaps-ap-top-25-losing-skid-upsets-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's Matt Rhule ends his drought against ranked opponents","description":"Rhule and Nebraska brought an end to the Cornhuskers coach's infamous decade-long streak against Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-21T20:58:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534102/nebraska-cornhuskers-matt-rhule-ranked-win-drought","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Syracuse QB Steve Angeli exits with injury, arm in sling","description":"Syracuse senior quarterback Steve Angeli left Saturday's game against Boston College with an injury to his throwing arm and will not return.","published":"2026-11-21T22:12:42.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552810/syracuse-qb-steve-angeli-exits-injury-arm-sling","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5146422/xavier-gilliam","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam"},"pick":{"pick":16,"round":1,"team":"NE","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Xavier Gilliam","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-18T13:13:47Z","intro":"Xavier Harold Gilliam is an American football defensive tackle for the Tennessee Volunteers. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Gilliam attended Wilde Lake High School in Columbia, Maryland and Quince Orchard High School in Gaithersburg, Maryland. He committed to play college football for the Penn State Nittany Lions over offers from Boston College, Maryland, Ole Miss, Texas A&M, West Virginia, and Virginia Tech."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman at Penn State in 2024, Gilliam was redshirted. During the 2025 season, he appeared in 13 games with two starts, totaling 15 tackles with two for loss, a forced fumble, and a blocked field goal. After the conclusion of the season, Gilliam entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nGilliam transferred to play for the Tennessee Volunteers. In the 2026 season opener, he posted six tackles with five for loss, and three sacks in a win over Furman."}]}}